changeling-hive-silence = Silence
changeling-hive-confirm-silence = Are you sure you want to expel {$name} from the hive? They will leave their current body and become a ghost, losing access to all hive bodies.
changeling-hive-consent-title = Join the hive?
changeling-hive-consent-prompt = Will you join the hive? Help its original host, speak with the other absorbed minds and inhabit vacant hive bodies. The host can take over your body, recall you to mindspace or expel you. If you decline or close this window, you will become a ghost and the role will be offered to another player.
changeling-hive-ghost-name = Absorbed Consciousness
changeling-hive-ghost-description = Join an existing changeling hive. Speak with its minds and help its host by controlling vacant hive bodies.
changeling-hive-ghost-rules = You are part of this hive. Cooperate with its original host and the other absorbed minds. The host may take over your body, recall you to mindspace or silence you.
changeling-hive-silenced = Your consciousness has been expelled from the hive. You are now a ghost.
changeling-hive-chat = [color=#c77dff]Hive — {$name}: {$message}[/color]
changeling-hive-absorbed = Your consciousness has been absorbed into the hive. Help your host; you can inhabit its vacant bodies.
changeling-assimilate-no-biomass = You need biomass equal to 25% of your body's maximum to assimilate this victim.
changeling-assimilate-invalid = You cannot assimilate this target into your hive.
changeling-assimilate-limit = Your hive cannot support another carrier.
changeling-assimilate-success = {$target} has joined your hive.
changeling-hive-briefing = You are an absorbed consciousness. Help your hive and its original host. Speak through the hive channel (+r). From mindspace you can observe the hive's bodies and inhabit vacant ones. The host can exchange bodies with you or recall you to mindspace.
language-ChangelingHive-name = Hive
language-ChangelingHive-description = A private connection between the minds of your own hive.
